@startuml
title Deployment Diagram - Autism Prediction System

node "Client Device" as Client {
  artifact "Web Browser"
}

node "Application Server (Flask)" as AppServer {
  artifact "app.py"
  artifact "templates/*"
  artifact "static/*"
}

node "Model/Data Storage" as Storage {
  artifact "model/best_model.pkl"
  artifact "model/adaboost_model.pkl"
  artifact "model/encoder.pkl"
  artifact "train.csv"
  artifact "users.json"
}

node "Python Runtime Environment" as Runtime {
  artifact "Flask"
  artifact "scikit-learn"
  artifact "pandas/numpy"
  artifact "matplotlib/seaborn"
  artifact "reportlab"
}

Client --> AppServer : HTTP/HTTPS\n(login, predict, performance,\nchart, download/pdf)
AppServer --> Storage : Read/Write files
AppServer --> Runtime : Execute app, ML inference,\nchart generation, PDF generation

@enduml
